
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#f9e5ec">
<title>Reason Why I Made This ♡</title>

<style>
* { box-sizing: border-box; }

body {
  margin: 0;
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  padding: 22px;
  background: linear-gradient(145deg,#fff8fa,#f7dce6,#fff9f7);
  color: #654453;
  font-family: Georgia,serif;
}

.panel {
  max-width: 750px;
  width: 100%;
  padding: clamp(25px,6vw,50px);
  background: #fffaf8e8;
  border: 1px solid #f0d4df;
  border-radius: 24px;
  box-shadow: 0 12px 35px #b66c8620;
  animation: fade .8s ease;
}

.small {
  font: 11px Arial,sans-serif;
  letter-spacing: .2em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #b4778e;
}

h1 {
  font-size: clamp(34px,8vw,48px);
  font-weight: normal;
  font-style: italic;
  color: #a34f70;
  margin: 20px 0;
}

p {
  font-size: 17px;
  line-height: 1.9;
  margin: 16px 0;
}

.buttons {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 12px;
  margin-top: 30px;
}

button {
  border: 0;
  border-radius: 999px;
  padding: 13px 25px;
  background: #a34f70;
  color: white;
  font: inherit;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.back {
  background: #d9a0b4;
}

@keyframes fade {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px); }
  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<main class="panel">

  <div class="small">A little explanation</div>

  <h1>Reason Why I Made This</h1>

  <p>
    I made this website simply to confess my feelings for you.
  </p>

  <p>
    I know you already know that I like you. But I heard that you're really straight, so I started avoiding you whenever you were around. Not because I didn't want to be near you, but because I didn't want to make things awkward or put you in an uncomfortable position.
  </p>

  <p>
    I don't expect anything in return. I just wanted to be honest about how I feel instead of keeping these feelings to myself.
  </p>

  <p>
    I made this little website because I wanted to express those feelings in my own way. And whatever your response may be, I hope you know that I genuinely mean every word.
  </p>

  <div class="buttons">

    <button class="back" onclick="location.href='page2.html'">
      ← Back
    </button>

    <button onclick="location.href='page4.html'">
      Show me the numbers ♡ →
    </button>

  </div>

</main>

</body>
</html>
